{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-5-20250929","id":"msg_011Cf6KWfGRqbuuRdEFrbf2A","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Perfect! The implementation is complete and builds successfully. \n\n## Summary\n\nI added the `GET /api/tags/popular` endpoint that returns the ten most-used tags with their article counts in descending order.\n\n### Files changed:\n\n1. **src/repositories/ITagRepository.ts** - Added `TagCount` interface and `listPopular()` method signature\n2. **src/repositories/PrismaTagRepository.ts** - Implemented `listPopular()` using Prisma to query tags ordered by article count\n3. **src/tags/TagService.ts** - Added `listPopular()` method that delegates to the repository\n4. **src/routes/tags.ts** - Added `GET /popular` route that returns `{ tags: [...] }` with name and count fields\n\nThe endpoint is now accessible at `/api/tags/popular` and returns JSON in the exact format requested:\n```json\n{\n  \"tags\": [\n    { \"name\": \"tag1\", \"count\": 15 },\n    { \"name\": \"tag2\", \"count\": 10 },\n    ...\n  ]\n}\n```"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":8,"cache_creation_input_tokens":301,"cache_read_input_tokens":36369,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":301},"output_tokens":1,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"638222aa-938b-44dd-bafd-7aa94c611cb3","uuid":"a0c11696-f307-44ad-8d4a-0b4e58882d88","timestamp":"2026-09-16T02:21:15.949Z","request_id":"req_011Cf6KWeqcu13UwPAuRt2Hf"}
